# ⏰ Digital Clock (HTML, CSS, JS)

A modern, responsive digital clock built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, featuring a sleek glassmorphism interface, live clock and date, dynamic greetings, 12/24-hour format toggle, smart alarms with snooze, stopwatch, countdown timer, 8 customizable themes, and persistent settings using Local Storage.

## Features

- Real-time hours, minutes, seconds
- 12-hour / 24-hour format toggle
- Auto greeting (Good Morning / Afternoon / Evening / Night)
- Full date display
- Smart alarm with ring, dismiss, and snooze options
- Built-in stopwatch with start, pause, reset, and lap tracking
- Countdown timer with custom duration
- 8 beautiful built-in themes
- Automatically saves selected theme after refresh
- Automatically saves alarms after refresh
- Fully responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)
- Local Storage API

